  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Design Phase Climate Information and Services for Africa is a component of WISER - Weather and climate Information and SERvices for Africa reported by FCDO with a funding type of 104 - Procurement of Services and a budget of &#xa3;144,137. This project benefits Africa, regional. It works in the following sector(s): Disaster prevention and preparedness, Environmental research, Food assistance, Agricultural policy and administrative management, Social Protection, Water sector policy and administrative management, Malaria control.</narrative>
